# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BASE DIRECTORY
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The one value to change if the Qalibre folder ever moves.
# All file paths below are expressed as filenames only —
# credentials.js prepends this path at runtime using path.join().
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
